factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The tamil_headline says the protesters were 'அரசு ஊழியர்கள்' (government employees), but the article only says the protest was organised by a district corporation and municipal workers' union; the article does not describe them as government employees.
  The tamil_headline says the protest was in 'கோட்டை' (Kottai) in front of the State Bank, but the article does not mention a headline location in the same way; the location claim is consistent, so this point is only partly relevant.
  The reel_script states the protest was 'பணி நிரந்தரம் கோரி' and the slides say 'த.வெ.க. தேர்தல் வாக்குறுதி' (TVK election promise); the article names the party as 'த.வெ.க.' but the reel_script's sentence 'த வெ க தேர்தல் வாக்குறுதி அளித்தது' is grammatically awkward and loses the sense that the promise was announced for those specific workers in the article.
  The reel_script combines two separate demands (regularisation promise and the Rs.700 daily wage order) into one run of sentences without the article's clear distinction between the regularisation demand and the wage/outsourcing demands, mixing facts.
